t-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">5 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">항에 따라 교섭요구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">사실에 대한 공고기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(2025.4.14.~4.20.)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">중 국립금오공과대학교에 교섭을 요구한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">노동조합에 대하여 아래와 같이 확정 공고합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">공고기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">:  2025. 4. 21.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) ~ 2025. 4. 25.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">교섭을 요구한 노동조합의 명칭 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">전국국공립대학교수노동조합</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">대표자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">남중웅</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">교섭 요구일자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: 2025. 4. 8.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">조합원수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(2025.4.8.</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) : 56</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:21.1pt;text-indent:-21.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">공고내용이 노동조합이 제출한 내용과 다르게 공고되거나 공고되지 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">않은 경우에는 공고기간 중에 교무과로 이의신청하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:21.1pt;text-indent:-21.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -21.1pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><b